    {
      "id": "note-master-thesis",
      "type": "note",
      "position": { "x": 100, "y": 150 },
      "config": {
        "content": "🧠 OMNIBUS MASTER THESIS\n\n• MACRO: BI Rate on hold → Liquidity moving back into equities. Watch rotation sequence: Banks → Energy → Consumer.\n• FOREIGN FLOW: Big 4 Banks (BBCA/BBRI/BMRI/BBNI) absorb 60-70% of net foreign buying. Signal amplifier for entire IDX.\n• COMMODITY PULSE: Coal benchmark (ICI) above $130 → ADRO/PTBA superdividend thesis intact.\n• CONSUMER THESIS: ICBP + MAPI benefit from lower BI Rate (cheaper credit, rising demand). Watch volume expansion.\n• TECH CATALYST: GOTO profitability target in view; TLKM data-center pivot underpriced by market.\n• MINING WILDCARD: AMMN copper + gold exposure — dual commodity tailwind. BREN nickel-to-battery EV play.",
        "color": "yellow",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 310
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-risk-matrix",
      "type": "note",
      "position": { "x": 570, "y": 150 },
      "config": {
        "content": "🛡️ RISK & POSITION MANAGEMENT MATRIX\n\n• Max sector exposure: 25% per sector.\n• Hard stop-loss: -5% from entry (daily close).\n• Scale-in rule: Add on volume > 1.5x avg_volume confirmation.\n• Pyramid out: Trim 33% at +8%, 33% at +15%, trail remainder.\n• Correlation risk: BBCA/BBRI/BMRI high correlation — treat as one position for sizing.\n• Macro veto: If USD/IDR > 16,500, pause new long entries; monitor foreign flow reversal.",
        "color": "pink",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 310
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-rotation-protocol",
      "type": "note",
      "position": { "x": 1000, "y": 150 },
      "config": {
        "content": "🔄 SECTOR ROTATION PROTOCOL\n\nPhase 1 — BANKS rally > 5% in 2 days:\n  → Watch ENERGY lag for entry.\nPhase 2 — ENERGY confirms breakout:\n  → Rotate 20% from BANKS to ADRO/PTBA.\nPhase 3 — CONSUMER volume expansion:\n  → ICBP/MAPI breakout signals late-cycle.\nPhase 4 — TECH breakout (GOTO/TLKM):\n  → Risk-on confirmation. Full portfolio deployed.\nPhase 5 — MINING surge (AMMN/BREN):\n  → Late-stage momentum. Tight stops. Exit plan active.",
        "color": "blue",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 310
      }
    },
